OL,15,     FColossal Coastal Train: The crew
OL,16,     Fhead to Germany to collect a
OL,17,     Fmaintenance machine so large it
OL,18,     Fneeds to be loaded onto two
OL,19,     Ftrucks. Eric and Chris oversee a
OL,20,     Fdiesel-engine exchange.
